note Synthetic metadata only. Test refs do not assert real qualification.
global Fail ulong 1
global Checks ulong 1
text good "EC303 unit PASS\n"
text fail "EC303 unit FAIL\n"

fn check expected ulong actual ulong to void
put Checks 0 add get Checks 0 1
if ne expected actual
put Fail 0 add get Fail 0 1
end
end
